          "name": "Annotations",
          "width": 1440,
          "height": 0,
          "content": "Card-based browsing layout (no DataTable)\nCategory cards grid: thumbnail, title, totalTime, watched indicator, View button\nVideo cards grid: thumbnail, title, duration, watched indicator, Play button\n[hash: deep link] #CATEGORYID;SUBCATEGORY:VIDEOID:POSITION\n[async: periodic submitWatchTime] track video watch progress\n3 player variants: VIDEO (video.js), STREAM (iframe), PDF (embedded viewer)\ngoBack button returns to previous view"
        }
      ]
    }
